          "type": "text",
          "text": "Ethiopic script font designed in a handwritten style.\n\nThe Geʾez Handwriting Arrows Only Regular provides the directional arrows, in isolation, for forming the strokes of each letter.\n\nThis font is part of a collection of 14 typefaces developed to help teach handwriting to children.\n\nProject Homepage: https://github.com/raeytype/geez-handwriting-fonts\n\n"
